# Cookie based Auth while SSR (Tanstack) : r/dotnet
created: 2026-05-13, last updated: 2026-05-02, [Read more](https://www.reddit.com/r/dotnet/comments/1t0275n/cookie_based_auth_while_ssr_tanstack/)

To resolve this, you must the incoming on theStack server retrieve the cookie, and manually attach to the of your fetch request the ASP.NET API.
